Keep a shared alphabet as empty text.
Place "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ" into alphabet.
Keep a shared piece as empty text.
Keep a shared upper as 0.

To test from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than 25, return.
If the slice of alphabet from spot to spot plus 1 matches piece, set upper to 1, return.
Test from spot plus 1.

The word is "FlaG".
The last is the last position of word.
The size is last plus 1.
The capitals is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
Set piece to the slice of word from spot to spot plus 1.
Set upper to 0.
Test from 0.
If upper is 1, add 1 to capitals.

The firstpiece is the slice of word from 0 to 1.
Set piece to firstpiece.
Set upper to 0.
Test from 0.
The firstupper is upper.
The valid is 0.
If capitals is size, set valid to 1.
If capitals is 0, set valid to 1.
If firstupper is 1 and capitals is 1, set valid to 1.
If valid is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
